# システム登録's 上書き refused (design 3.10.10, 11.32) on the x64 PC, for tools/x64/ui_run64.py
# with a second NVMe whose TessronOS keeps the list of a newer system (the KTWIN-R image after
# the sysinst group of tests/ktest/x86_64/ktest_sysinst.c, given as UI_EXTRA as in
# ui_sysinst64_keep.steps): 上書きする is greyed with why, neither way is chosen, and [開始]
# asks for one to be chosen rather than going on to 初期化; nothing is written.
logmark
open 01a0d8c4-54c0-7a11-8c22-4d5e6f7054c0
expectsincein 60 sysinst: opened 1
expectsincein 120 sysinst: keep nvmeb 0 -1: 15
waitwin システム登録 30
wait 500
shot sysinst64_newer_open
win システム登録
logmark
click 880 288
wait 800
shot sysinst64_newer_start
absent sysinst: plan
key 08 01
expectsince sysinst: closed
absent sysinst: started
absent !OACV!
